ores end to end, in Liquid and headless Hydrogen: sections, product pages, cart and checkout, with performance, SEO and structured data built in from day one. I ship 30-page stores solo in days to weeks, and extend the platform with checkout UI extensions, Shopify Functions and custom apps when it falls short. Founder of LIVRA, a reading app I built and run alone (React, Capacitor, Firebase)."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experience"}],[["$","div","SHAKERS",{"className":"resume-entry","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"resume-row","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["SHAKERS",["$","span",null,{"className":"resume-context","children":[" — ","Shopify agency · São Paulo"]}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"resume-period","children":"May 2024 – Present"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"resume-roles","children":[["$","p","Squad Leader — Shopify Expert, Headless & Liquid",{"className":"resume-row","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Squad Leader — Shopify Expert, Headless & Liquid"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"resume-period","children":"Aug 2025 – Present"}]]}],["$","p","Junior Front-end Developer",{"className":"resume-row","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Junior Front-end Developer"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"resume-period","children":"Apr 2025 – Aug 2025"}]]}],["$","p","Front-end Intern",{"className":"resume-row","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Front-end Intern"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"resume-period","children":"May 2024 – Apr 2025"}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Build complete Shopify stores alone, 30+ pages, from theme sections to product page, cart and checkout, in Liquid and Hydrogen. Live work includes Fujifilm Brazil, Qix Skate Shop and UV Line.",{"children":"Build complete Shopify stores alone, 30+ pages, from theme sections to product page, cart and checkout, in Liquid and Hydrogen. Live work includes Fujifilm Brazil, Qix Skate Shop and UV Line."}],["$","li","Led the squad on Roland and Boss Brazil's headless Hydrogen storefronts. Drove the architecture of the agency's first shared cart: one cart and one checkout across two brand domains, chosen over synced carts to rule out race conditions.",{"children":"Led the squad on Roland and Boss Brazil's headless Hydrogen storefronts. Drove the architecture of the agency's first shared cart: one cart and one checkout across two brand domains, chosen over synced carts to rule out race conditions."}],"$L2","$L3","$L4","$L5"]}]]}],"$L6"]]}],"$L7","$L8","$L9"]}]],null,"$La"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ddqHFKFEBR7Z91zl7uR1t"}
